		(uuid "6dc3fbad-a2eb-5494-bb0c-c244d19d0293")
	)
	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE L1:\nJ3 on the left (LV) edge, on the FPGA side of the isolation barrier with side 1 of [10]. Every signal has a GND_FPGA neighbour on the ribbon. GND_FPGA is its own pour under J3 and the isolator side 1, not board GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.76 93.98 0)
		(size 52 16)
		(margins 1 1 1 1)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 255 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a0e55117-c5eb-416f-b879-3488f1c5cd9f")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\nJ3 2x8 IDC: 1 +3V3_FPGA, 3 SPI_SCLK, 5 SPI_MOSI, 7 SPI_MISO, 9 SPI_CS_DAC, 11 SPI_CS_ADC, 13 ENABLE (3.3 V; low or open = switches open), 15 spare GPIO for the safety logic (NC now); even pins GND_FPGA. All nets here are FPGA-side; they cross to the board only through [10]. [ASSUME] +3V3_FPGA from the FPGA powers isolator side 1 (ICD_J3 said no power on J3: decide and update the ICD). Analog DAC_CMD / read-back pins are gone: [11] and [12] do that."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.76 60.96 0)
		(size 52 30)
		(margins 1 1 1 1)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a0e58381-7da8-4c47-8179-6f961d1051b2")
	)
	(text_box "MISC NOTE M1:\nFPGA: hold the DAC at 0 for 3 ms after ENABLE (D-08; the AQY214S closes in 0.5 ms, so this can shorten); clear the DAC when ENABLE drops; one SPI bus, two chip selects (DAC [11], ADC [12]); subtract VMID_REF from both read-back channels in software."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.76 113.03 0)
		(size 52 16)
		(margins 1 1 1 1)
		(stroke
			(width 0.8)
			(type solid)
			(color 255 165 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a0e5e42c-e83d-4e49-a286-45f07c073526")
	)
